# Project Information

## Project identity

**Project name:** RadioMaster Kazakh Voice Pack

**Language:** Kazakh / Қазақ тілі

**Country of origin:** Kazakhstan

**Initial release:** 2026

## Purpose

The project was created to introduce a high-quality Kazakh-language voice interface for RadioMaster radio control systems.

The project is intended to support:

- FPV pilots;
- RC model users;
- drone clubs;
- robotics clubs;
- technical education;
- Kazakh-speaking users;
- educators and students.

## Localization

The localization includes the translation of technical voice messages used by compatible RadioMaster systems.

Particular attention is given to:

- correct Kazakh terminology;
- natural pronunciation;
- clarity of voice messages;
- technical meaning;
- consistency of terminology.

